# Markup follow-up

- Preserve entity-looking link destinations during mark serialization. A PM link
  with href `https://x/?a=&copy;` serializes with `©` in its destination because
  `markdownLinkDestination` leaves `&` unescaped before the internal Markdown
  reparse. Reproduced on the codec-link-words branch and its pre-fix parent;
  independent of the removed MDX angle expansion. Cover both codecs when fixing.
